      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Muni Services"
        ],
        "summary": "APIs that allow BofA Securities customers of Municipal Banking and Markets to transact Municipal securities. This API provides the customer the ability to retrieve the history of bids submitted to BofA (including today\u2019s) via the API and via the Mercury\u2122 platform",
