      "bidHistoryRequest": {
        "required": [
          "searchRequest"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "searchRequest": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/searchRequest"
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "example": {
          "searchRequest": {
            "criteria": [
              {
                "field": "accountNumber",
                "operand": "=",
                "value": "123456789"
              },
              {
                "field": "cusip",
                "operand": "=",
                "value": "123456789"
              },
              {
                "field": "investorSymbol",
                "operand": "=",
                "value": "OLDKENT"
              },
              {
                "field": "status",
                "operand": "=",
                "value": "Submitted"
              },
              {
                "field": "bidIdFrom",
                "operand": ">=",
                "value": "123455"
              },
              {
                "field": "bidIdTo",
                "operand": "<=",
                "value": "123458"
              },
              {
                "field": "creationDateFrom",
                "operand": ">=",
                "value": "2020-02-05"
              },
              {
                "field": "creationDateTo",
                "operand": "<=",
                "value": "2020-02-05"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "searchRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "criteria": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Array of bid search criteria",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/criteriaItem"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Bid search request"
      },
      "criteriaItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "field": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Field represent different offer criteria properties.<br><br>'field': 'accountNumber' <br>'description': Your firm\u2019s account number at BofA Securities if you are an Institutional customer. If you are a broker/dealer, it will be your EBN symbol prefixed with \u201cEBN\u201d<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': If you are a broker/dealer, your operations team will be able to provide you the EBN symbol to use. For (a possibly out of date) list, see DTCC. Ex. Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Inc. has MLCO as the symbol and you would provide \u201cEBNMLCO\u201d in the request. Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.  <br><br>'field': 'cusip'<br>'description': CUSIP with or without the 9th check digit. <br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported. <br><br>'field': 'investorSymbol'<br>'description': Deprecated. <br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': <br><br>'field': 'status'<br>'description': Workflow status of the bid. \nCan have one of the following values: \n\u201cSubmitted\u201d,\u201cAccepted\u201d, \u201cSubmitted for Execution\u201d, or \u201cExecuted\u201d \nThese enumerations will not change.\nWhen the bid has been received by BofA Securities via the API, but has not yet been accepted, its state will be \u201cSubmitted\u201d. \u201cAccepted\u201d indicates that the trading desk has it in their bid list.  \u201cExecuted\u201d or \u201cDenied\u201d are the end states depending on the whether the trade has completed successfully when the bid is \u201chit\u201d. When the bid is hit and it has been queued for trade execution, its state will be \u201cSubmitted for Execution\u201d.<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported. It can be a comma separated list <br><br>'field': 'bidIdFrom'<br>'description': Bid reference number range. This is the BofA Securities reference number that was provided in the response to the Bid request API. <br>'type': 'integer'<br>'additional': Operand \u201c>=\u201d supported in From <br><br>'field': 'bidIdTo'<br>'description': Bid reference number range. This is the BofA Securities reference number that was provided in the response to the Bid request API. . <br>'type': 'integer'<br>'additional': Operands, \u201c<=\u201d supported in To<br><br>'field': 'creationDateFrom'<br>'description': Bid creation date range. Expected format YYYY-MM-DD. All numbers.. <br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Operand \u201c>=\u201d supported in From <br><br>'field': 'creationDateTo'<br>'description': Bid creation date range. Expected format YYYY-MM-DD. All numbers.. <br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Operands, \u201c<=\u201d supported in To<br>"
          },
          "operand": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Valid operand corresponding to field"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Value set for criteria field"
          }
        }
      },
